<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 10/11.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 10/11.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on</p>
<p>Thursday set the following currency fixings for July 11. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   11.07.97	  10.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.7428	    6.7518</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2678	    2.2741</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.4618	    4.4782</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5474	    3.5439</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5168	    0.5161</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7645	    0.7663</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2835	    0.2843</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0188	    7.0200</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6925	    0.6922</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2070	    1.2107</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
